(Wystarczy podać nazwę lalki).","location_description":"w mieście","npc_lines":["Hiddeliho my friend Jogador!","Oh! <giggles> Have you found all six parts of a jester doll and would like to assemble them?","Goodie! Here you are! <giggles>","Hiddeliho my friend Jogador!","I'm here to enrich your life and to sell little trinkets of fun and joy. Just ask about my goods if you like to learn more.","I sell special spellwands, pillows and presents that have ... funny effects. Where would be the fun if I told everything you about it? Ask me for a trade!","Have fun with all my ... funny stuff.","I'm the lovely, inimitable, and hilarious Hoaxette. I'll stay here for the whole month before I leave this country again.","Oh! <giggles> Have you found all six parts of a jester doll and would like me to assemble them?","Well, admittedly, owning parts of a doll can be just as fun. Hehe!","Are you trying to make a fool out of me? You don't have all six body parts!","I'm here to enrich your life and to sell little trinkets of fun and joy. Just ask about my goods if you like to learn more.","If it were up to me, the whole year would be prank time!","A prank in the morning and the day won't be boring <giggles>. I offer funny items for this purpose. Let me know if you are interested in my offers.","I'd love to play a prank on the king if he showed up here. <giggles>","I'm not specialised in telling jokes - I'm offering ITEMS that make people laugh. I can tell you something about my offers if you are interested.","I sell special spellwands, pillows and presents that have ... funny effects. Where would be the fun if I told everything you about it? Ask me for a trade!","See you, Jogador! Have fun playing pranks on your friends!"],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"sklepikarz","quest_references":[],"specialty":"sprzęt","tp_coordinate_frame":"tibiopedia-map-pixels-floor-unverified","tp_map_markers":[],"tp_trade_available":"tak","tp_tra